# Global instructions

## Doltap

A shared knowledge base is available through the `doltap` MCP server (tools `wiki_search`, `wiki_get`, `wiki_upsert`, `wiki_patch_section`, …) and the `doltap` CLI. Before repetitive or cross-project work (deploy, build, release, auth, retry, config, library version questions), run `wiki_search` first. After solving a problem for the second time or finding an undocumented pitfall, record it with `wiki_upsert` or `wiki_patch_section`. The `doltap` skill has the full procedure.
